Vendor / OS logos (src/ui/logo_data.h)
======================================

The brand marks are taken from Simple Icons 16.37.0 (https://simpleicons.org,
npm package "simple-icons"), rasterized to 48x48 alpha masks and drawn in a
single neutral colour (they are never recoloured to signal state: the status
dot is drawn separately). Simple Icons is released under CC0 1.0; icons
that carry their own licence are listed below.

All logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective
owners. FeTerm is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them; a logo is
shown only to identify the platform a saved session connects to.

