dell fedora fortinet freebsd gentoo huawei junipernetworks kalilinux linux
linuxmint apple mikrotik nixos nokia openbsd opensuse opnsense
paloaltonetworks pfsense proxmox raspberrypi redhat rockylinux ubiquiti
ubuntu vmware

Drawn for FeTerm (no third-party artwork; MIT like the rest of FeTerm):
the generic terminal, server and network icons, the status dot, and the
letter badges for Arista ("Ar"), Check Point ("CP"), HPE / Aruba ("HP"),
VyOS ("Vy") and Windows ("W"). The badge letters are outlines of DejaVu
Sans Bold (Bitstream Vera licence, permits this use).
